overlap and multiplicity constraints were explicitly checked.\n\n## Optimization iterations\n\n### Event selection strategies (validation)\n\n| Configuration | Triplet reconstruction efficiency | Truth selected |\n|---|---:|---:|\n\'\'\'\nfor x in sel[\'validation_strategy_comparison\']:\n md+=f"| {x[\'configuration\']} | {x[\'validation_triplet_reconstruction_efficiency\']:.6f} | {x[\'selected_truth\']} |\\n"\nmd+=\'\'\'\n### Classifier variants with pairmax selection (validation)\n\n| Configuration | Best iteration | Validation AUC | Triplet reconstruction efficiency |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n\'\'\'\nfor x in variants:\n md+=f"| {x[\'name\']} (depth {x[\'max_depth\']}, eta {x[\'eta\']}) | {x[\'best_iteration\']} | {x[\'validation_auc_xgb\']:.6f} | {x[\'validation_pairmax_efficiency\']:.6f} |\\n"\nmd+=\'\'\'\nThe baseline was retained: although the shallow model had essentially tied candidate AUC, its event-level disjoint-selection recall was lower. Training detail is in `train/training_report_xgb.json`, variant data in `train/model_variant_comparison.json`, and held-out inference details in `infer/inference_report_xgb.json`.\n\n## Mass sanity check\n\n`select_triplets/plots/triplet_mass_comparison.png` compares selected held-out masses against validation truth and combinatorial candidates. The selected mass distribution has median 173.1 GeV and broad 5--95% range 131.8--412.4 GeV; no artificially narrow mass-window cut was applied. Numerical comparison and interpretation are in `sanity_checks/mass_sanity_report.json` and `sanity_checks/mass_sanity_note.md`.\n\'\'\'\nopen(R/\'optimization_report.md\',\'w\').write(md)\nPY\npython3 - <<\'PY\'\nimport pandas as pd, json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nR=Path(\'/root/results\')\nraw=pd.read_parquet(R/\'dataset_build/triplets_raw.parquet\')\ninf=pd.read_parquet(R/\'infer/inference_test_xgb.parquet\')\nsel=pd.read_parquet(R/\'select_triplets/selected_triplets.parquet\')\nev=pd.read_parquet(R/\'select_triplets/event_selection.parquet\')\nrep=json.load(open(R/\'select_triplets/selection_report.json\'))\nassert {\'event_id\',\'i\',\'j\',\'k\',\'is_truth\',\'dr_ab\',\'dr_ac\',\'dr_bc\',\'mij_over_m123_ab\',\'mij_over_m123_ac\',\'mij_over_m123_bc\'} <= set(raw)\nassert {\'event_id\',\'i\',\'j\',\'k\',\'is_truth\',\'score_xgb\'} <= set(inf)\nassert {\'event_id\',\'selected_rank\',\'i\',\'j\',\'k\',\'score\',\'triplet_pt\',\'triplet_eta\',\'triplet_phi\',\'triplet_mass\'} <= set(sel)\nassert ev.n_top_selected.max() <= 2 and sel.groupby(\'event_id\').size().max() <= 2\nfor _,g in sel.groupby(\'event_id\'):\n    if len(g)==2: assert not (set(g.iloc[0][[\'i\',\'j\',\'k\']]) & set(g.iloc[1][[\'i\',\'j\',\'k\']]))\nassert int(sel.is_truth.sum())==rep[\'selected_truth_triplets\']\nassert int(inf.is_truth.sum())==rep[\'inference_truth_triplets\']\nprint(\'FINAL VALIDATION PASS\')\nprint(\'efficiency =\',rep[\'triplet_reconstruction_efficiency\'],f"({rep[\'selected_truth_triplets\']}/{rep[\'inference_truth_triplets\']})")\nprint(\'candidate/event constraints valid; all required data columns present\')\nprint(\'sanity files:\',[(p.name,p.exists()) for p in [R/\'sanity_checks/mass_sanity_report.json\',R/\'sanity_checks/mass_sanity_note.md\',R/\'select_triplets/plots/triplet_mass_comparison.png\']])\nPY\n'] min_timeout_sec: 3.0 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
